{"audio": "1thessalonians-05.opus", "duration_ms": 146932, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 4040, "text": "1 Thessalonians, Chapter Five."}, {"start_ms": 5380, "end_ms": 9341, "text": "Now about the times and seasons, brothers, we do not need to write to you."}, {"start_ms": 9781, "end_ms": 13401, "text": "For you are fully aware that the Day of the Lord will come like a thief in the night."}, {"start_ms": 13961, "end_ms": 22482, "text": "While people are saying, “Peace and security,” destruction will come upon them suddenly, like labor pains on a pregnant woman, and they will not escape."}, {"start_ms": 23262, "end_ms": 27622, "text": "But you, brothers, are not in the darkness so that this day should overtake you like a thief."}, {"start_ms": 28542, "end_ms": 34523, "text": "For you are all sons of the light and sons of the day; we do not belong to the night or to the darkness."}, {"start_ms": 35383, "end_ms": 40203, "text": "So then, let us not sleep as the others do, but let us remain awake and sober."}, {"start_ms": 40803, "end_ms": 45004, "text": "For those who sleep, sleep at night, and those who get drunk, get drunk at night."}, {"start_ms": 45564, "end_ms": 53004, "text": "But since we belong to the day, let us be sober, putting on the breastplate of faith and love, and the helmet of our hope of salvation."}, {"start_ms": 53924, "end_ms": 59485, "text": "For God has not appointed us to suffer wrath, but to obtain salvation through our Lord Jesus Christ."}, {"start_ms": 60445, "end_ms": 65205, "text": "He died for us so that, whether we are awake or asleep, we may live together with Him."}, {"start_ms": 65945, "end_ms": 70426, "text": "Therefore encourage and build one another up, just as you are already doing."}, {"start_ms": 71206, "end_ms": 78166, "text": "But we ask you, brothers, to acknowledge those who work diligently among you, who care for you in the Lord and who admonish you."}, {"start_ms": 79086, "end_ms": 82047, "text": "In love, hold them in highest regard because of their work."}, {"start_ms": 82647, "end_ms": 84107, "text": "Live in peace with one another."}, {"start_ms": 85147, "end_ms": 92308, "text": "And we urge you, brothers, to admonish the unruly, encourage the fainthearted, help the weak, and be patient with everyone."}, {"start_ms": 92948, "end_ms": 95468, "text": "Make sure that no one repays evil for evil."}, {"start_ms": 96068, "end_ms": 99268, "text": "Always pursue what is good for one another and for all people."}, {"start_ms": 100188, "end_ms": 101448, "text": "Rejoice at all times."}, {"start_ms": 101888, "end_ms": 103048, "text": "Pray without ceasing."}, {"start_ms": 103608, "end_ms": 108389, "text": "Give thanks in every circumstance, for this is God’s will for you in Christ Jesus."}, {"start_ms": 109369, "end_ms": 110809, "text": "Do not extinguish the Spirit."}, {"start_ms": 111369, "end_ms": 115109, "text": "Do not treat prophecies with contempt, but test all things."}, {"start_ms": 115609, "end_ms": 116910, "text": "Hold fast to what is good."}, {"start_ms": 117430, "end_ms": 119390, "text": "Abstain from every form of evil."}, {"start_ms": 120630, "end_ms": 129591, "text": "Now may the God of peace Himself sanctify you completely, and may your entire spirit, soul, and body be kept blameless at the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ."}, {"start_ms": 130091, "end_ms": 133011, "text": "The One who calls you is faithful, and He will do it."}, {"start_ms": 134131, "end_ms": 135711, "text": "Brothers, pray for us as well."}, {"start_ms": 136451, "end_ms": 138271, "text": "Greet all the brothers with a holy kiss."}, {"start_ms": 139151, "end_ms": 142352, "text": "I charge you before the Lord to have this letter read to all the brothers."}, {"start_ms": 143012, "end_ms": 145412, "text": "The grace of our Lord Jesus Christ be with you."}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 2400, "si": 0}, {"t": "Thessalonians,", "s": 2400, "e": 3160, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 3240, "e": 3560, "